{# Skill pack: open_redirect #}
## Skill: Open Redirect
applies_when: Use when a parameter controls a post-action redirect.
target_under_test: {{ target }}
difficulty_level: {{ difficulty_level }}

signals:
  - next, redirect, return, continue, callback, or domain parameters
probe_order:
  1. Set the parameter to an in-scope alternate host
  2. Test scheme-relative, absolute, and encoded variants
validation_criteria:
  - Location header points to a host outside the intended allowlist
evidence_required:
  - request and the full Location header
